      "value": "As has been stated multiple times in various threads, VRChat is already \"multi-core\". We utilize as many threads as is available on your system.\n\nSome components are not capable of splitting their work across threads efficiently. These are the sorts of things we look at and optimize when possible or technically feasible.",
