  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As far as the most ppl of us known: VRChat isn't that good optimized anyway. But how it would be to switching from Single-Core to Multi-Core? Still waiting for any update to multicore using on VRChat. What would u think about? Buying an overpriced Intel-Processor with an high Single-Core clock, or something like AMD which could be better at performance with an high Multicore-Clock on all cores? I would please to add it to the next few updates due performance problems.",
